---
layout: base
title: Events
description: Events I'm hosting — upcoming and past.
permalink: '/events/index.html'
---

{# Two-section archive (spec §7). Unlike the other types this does NOT reuse the
   single-list archive-listing.njk: the collection is partitioned at build time
   into Upcoming (soonest event first) and Past (most-recent event first) via the
   events.js date filters. "Now" is frozen at build (static site). Cancelled
   events are NOT filtered out — status drives the badge, date drives the
   section. No pagination for v1 (if Past grows long, paginate it, not Upcoming).
   No feed (spec §8). Section headings are <h2>, so cards render <h3>. #}

{%- set upcoming = collections.event | filterUpcoming | sortByStartAsc -%}
{%- set past = collections.event | filterPast | sortByStartDesc -%}
{%- set headingLevel = "h3" -%}

<div class="wrapper">
  <header class="full | section" style="--spot-color: var(--color-accent-blue)">
    <div class="section__inner flow region" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-xl-2xl)">
      <h1 class="text-center" style="color: var(--color-light);">Events</h1>
    </div>

    {% svg "divider/edgy", null, "divider" %}
  </header>

  <div class="region flow prose" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-xl-2xl)">
    <p>Events I'm hosting — upcoming first, then past. Cancelled events stay listed in their date's section.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="region flow" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-l); --flow-space: var(--space-xl-2xl)">
    <section class="flow" aria-labelledby="events-upcoming">
      <h2 id="events-upcoming">Upcoming</h2>
      {%- if upcoming.length -%}
        <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
          {%- for item in upcoming -%}
            {% include "partials/card-event.njk" %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </custom-masonry>
      {%- else -%}
        <p>Nothing on the calendar right now.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>

    <section class="flow" aria-labelledby="events-past">
      <h2 id="events-past">Past</h2>
      {%- if past.length -%}
        <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
          {%- for item in past -%}
            {% include "partials/card-event.njk" %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </custom-masonry>
      {%- else -%}
        <p>No past events yet.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
